## what this rules out
The vertex stage, the instance data and the interpolated normals are byte-stable (the trace text
is identical AND the trace picture is identical), because the shader's --lighting-trace branch
returns at native/src/native_renderer_shaders.cpp:627-629 BEFORE the lighting call at :621 and
therefore never reads leafAmbientCubeFaces. What changes between runs is only the picture the
lighting branch produces, i.e. which cube each instance ended up reading.
